WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.091 --> 00:00:14.546
<v Maya>You know, usually when we talk about a dystopian future where language is controlled, we kind of go straight to George Orwell. We think of 1984 and the concept of new speak, like this idea of language being deliberately</v>

2
