<v Daniel>someone uses AI to polish a cover letter or write an email.</v>

8
00:01:17.179 --> 00:01:32.063
<v Maya>I really want to visualize this for a second because it's such a subtle shift. It's like putting a heavy beauty filter on a photo. It smooths out all the wrinkles. It fixes the lighting. It makes everything look conventionally better according to some invisible algorithm. But if you crank</v>

