27
00:04:00.185 --> 00:04:14.932
<v Maya>That is a really smart cross-section. You've got the highly technical, the hyperlocal, and the wildly informal. And to figure out what was human and what was AI, they used an AI detection tool called binoculars. So when they mapped this out, did the</v>

