29
00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:35.169
<v Daniel>It did get blander, but the client tells a much more nuanced story about how humans actually adopt technology. Let's look at the RQ for a computer science abstracts first. They found a massive sustained decline in the variance of writing complexity immediately</v>

