43
00:06:19.563 --> 00:06:34.490
<v Maya>OK, I'm glad you brought that up because I have to play the skeptic here. If I'm looking at the Internet in 2023 and 2024, the world is a chaotic mess. We're coming out of a global pandemic. There are massive cultural shifts happening everywhere. Sure. Correlation isn't causation.</v>

44
00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:45.657
<v Maya>How do we know the A.I. actually caused the homogenization on red in arcs of maybe human culture just globally shifted toward a less diverse, safer linguistic style?</v>

