<v Maya>Ah, so they needed a control group uncontaminated by 2023 culture.</v>

47
00:07:01.245 --> 00:07:15.870
<v Daniel>Exactly. They went back and gathered 1,000 human-authored texts from Reddit and ArcSieve that were written before ChatGPT even existed. They essentially froze that human writing in amber. Then they had three different models.</v>

