60
00:08:37.411 --> 00:08:52.220
<v Maya>So if you are a user and you only check to see if the model changed what you said, the AI passes with flying colors, you read it and think, yep, that's exactly what I meant to say. It just sounds better. The loss is happening in a dimension nobody is auditing. The texture, the rhythm, the individuality, that's what quietly gets erased.</v>

61
00:08:52.568 --> 00:09:06.711
