104
00:15:11.321 --> 00:15:23.688
<v Maya>Okay, let's unpack this for the real world because it's easy to get lost in the theory. If I'm not a sociolinguist, if I'm just a person going to work, why should I care that my extroversion pronouns are missing from my polished email? What is the actual harm here?</v>

